This is a separate issue.  It looks like your application is referencing a file in your C: drive.  In order for your application to run on shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io>, any files that i loads up NEED to be within the directory structure of your application and needs to be loaded with relative paths, not absolute paths.
Our company is out on vacation today and tomorrow so unfortunately we will have minimal ability to provide support during that time.
I hope that gets you over the hump.

Best,
Tareef

