Fabrice,

You are correct. Currently shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> and our support system DO NOT share a login, so you will need a separate account for shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> support.

For customers with paid plans, the easiest way to report issues is to email shinyapp...@rstudio.com which will open a ticket for you.

-Andy

